          "text": "and fault experiments. ## What the run demonstrates - 17,379 real hourly observations, 731 observed dates, and 3,292,679 represented rentals; input SHA-256 and versions retained. - Eleven behavioral tests cover contracts, schema errors, approval denial, forged proposal hashes, instruction strings, string booleans, and explicit scoped approval. - 21 controlled batches, seeds 7/17/29: row detection precision 1.00, recall 0.80; zero alarms on three clean controls. These are designed faults on one dataset, not real-world detection accuracy. - Spark transforms typed rows; dbt gates daily aggregates before Iceberg mutation. Repeating an identical snapshot is checked against actual table contents and returns `unchanged`. - The first observed local run took about 15 seconds after dependency installation; timing depends on the environment. No paid model API is invoked; cloud cost is unmeasured, not zero. ## Architecture ```mermaid flowchart TD A[Attributed UCI CSV] --> B[Contracts and bounded proposal] B --> C[LangGraph approval interrupt] C -->"
